    "description": "<p>Creates a 1.5m area of swarming insects for {{math spellPower \"/\" 2}} turns. Deals 2d6 Physical Damage per turn and forces a Nerve test for panic each turn. Applies a 10% penalty to Success Rolls, -1 Reaction, prevents Aiming, and imposes a 50% penalty to ranged attacks and Perception tests. Ignores armor. The swarm can be moved up to 3 hexes per turn as a free action. Effect of this spell can be neutralised with Repellent ointment or relevant spells such as Fiery aura</p>",
